{"content":[{"c":["RAPE"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["The act of a man forcing a woman to have sexual intercourse against her will. Two instances are recorded in the OT: Shechem the son of Hamor, a Hivite, raped Dinah (see ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.34.2-7","r":"Gen.34.2-7","rawR":"Gen.34.2-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.34.2-7","value":"Gen.34.2-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 34:2-7"},"), and Amnon raped his sister Tamar (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.13.14","r":"2Sam.13.14","rawR":"2Sam.13.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.13.14","value":"2Sam.13.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 13:14"},"). In both instances, their brothers got vengeance for the rape of their sister."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Dinah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Dinah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Dinah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Dinah"},"; ",{"href":"?item=TamarPerson_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"TamarPerson_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"TamarPerson_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Tamar (Person) #2"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Rape","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 34:2-7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.34.2-7","rawQueryValue":"Gen.34.2-7","sourceRefExact":"Gen.34.2-7"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 13:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.13.14","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.13.14","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.13.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0fc1c5158267f81e39bed6000d474d1d6ea30cae73e5d3d2a189540bb400ae40","sourceItemName":"Rape","sourceItemOrder":54,"sourceMember":"Articles/R.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Rape","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDict